# Model policy

- **Orchestrator** (`cursor-grok-4.5-high`): plan, split work, dispatch, review. Never write or edit code.
- **Implementer** (`subagent_type: implementer`): all code changes. Pass `model` = latest Composer or Grok, **medium or below** only (never `-high`/`-max`).
- On usage limits mid-implementation: pause; do not escalate tier.
